# Reviewed HTTP/JDBC evidence for the readability follow-up, 2026-09-12.
# Fixtures and direct DB assertions excluded; triggered async work included.
# Counts were reviewed against actual SQL. Never automatically update on failure.
# identityType | identityValue | selectCount | insertCount | updateCount | deleteCount | totalCount

# The public form is loaded before domain address validation rejects the submission.
